// SR 172.010.1 — Chapter 1a Requests for Information from Council Members and Parliamentary Committees
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Inserted by No I of the O of 19 Nov. 2003, in force since 1 Dec. 2003 (AS 2003 4117).
